WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900
Rikka-san is quite skilled.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.050
She'll present an argument on her own, 
literally die for it on her own,

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:17.320
then come back to life on 
her own to retake the flow.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.000
But I'm not alone.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:25.620
Kuro-senpai and I won't 
let you have your way.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:30.220
Right. Even if the third solution is rejected,

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.590
it's not like all of them 
have gone in that direction.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.630
Some percentage should've switched 
over to the side that doesn't believe

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.350
in the ghost named Steel Lady Nanase.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.680
And I'm not worried about a small 
percentage that may have dissented.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.810
Huh?

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.370
I'm sure there are some who've been 
satisfied with the explanation thus far,

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.900
but they aren't part of my calculations.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.930
Rikka-san is thinking the same thing as you

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:56.300
and deciding her futures by selecting 
the ones with the fewest dissenters.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:01.140
She's assuming that I'm trying to 
chip away at her influence in stages.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.040
But that's where my trap begins.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:11.300
My solutions thus far have included 
the previous ones to some extent.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.880
Detective Terada investigating 
Steel Lady Nanase on his own.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:20.930
Nanase Karin's father leaving behind 
a damning handwritten note.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.750
Even if they reject the 
conclusions of each solution,

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.030
the basic elements themselves 
have not been rejected.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:29.030
Even though our third 
solution was just rejected,

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:30.940
as well as the portrait 
of the killer from it,

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.030
no one has doubted the part where

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:37.280
I said that Nanase Karin's sister was 
the one who gave the media the note.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:40.700
Rikka-san will be satisfied 
as long as the conclusion of

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:45.290
"a ghost named Nanase Karin 
doesn't exist" isn't believed.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:49.540
So there's no reason to destroy 
my solutions at their roots.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:53.650
She can achieve her goal just 
by crushing the conclusions.

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.530
If she tried to start destroying any 
other part besides the conclusion,

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.050
she'd stand out more.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.260
Therefore, Rikka-san is forced 
to take the simplest option.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.940
B-But then...

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.780
<i>Is she saying that what 
Rikka-san is doing now...</i>

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.210
<i>The futures she has chosen...</i>

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:12.570
<i>are all part of her plan?</i>

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.070
All of the preparations have been made.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:18.320
All that's left is to unleash the final blow.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.920
Fiction is born within the fiction

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.220
and inverts itself into truth.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.380
Then Steel Lady Nanase will disappear.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.510
Let us move on to the fourth solution!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.870
Even then, Steel Lady Nanase is fiction!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.580
The three solutions I've presented thus far

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.510
were just the foundation to 
get to the actual truth.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.970
There is someone behind this.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.720
The one who created a ghost named Steel 
Lady Nanase and killed Detective Terada.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.180
<i>We've been waiting for this!</i>

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.740
<b>Anonymous</b>

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.530
<i>Just give it up.</i>

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Anon</b>

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.720
<i>Jeez, you're persistent.</i>

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Nameless</b>

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:52.220
The one behind all this is 
none other than Nanase Karin,

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.460
Nanase Haruko herself.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.740
She's not dead!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:59.170
The one who died at the construction site

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.830
was someone else made to look like Karin!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.150
If you have a faceless corpse, it's a given

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.910
that they've actually been 
switched out with someone else.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:10.580
The real Nanase Karin is still alive.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.220
<i>But that was debunked earlier.</i>

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:17.080
<i>Come on. No one believes 
that TV drama-esque story.</i>

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.590
<i>But if Nanase Karin was alive, 
there'd be no Steel Lady Nanase.</i>

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:25.620
Nanase Karin lost her 
family and was all alone.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.450
<i>If I just wait a while, 
the rumors will settle down.</i>

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:32.060
<i>I mean, I won't be able 
to be an idol anymore...</i>

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:34.200
<i>But I'm still young.</i>

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.560
<i>I still have time to start over.</i>

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.130
Excuse me!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:43.980
Huh?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.950
I'm sorry, I know this is sudden.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:51.250
But I was just thinking... 
that you look like me.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.200
And that was when she met her.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:58.140
Though their faces were different, 
the length of her hair, her physique,

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:00.410
and their ages were quite similar.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.670
Let's just call her A-san for now.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.300
No one knows what A-san's
circumstances were.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:12.010
Perhaps she didn't have any friends or family, 
or she suffered from a mental illness.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:17.890
But unfortunately, Nanase Karin found her.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:22.150
<i>If I can leave Nanase Karin behind 
and start over as a new person...</i>

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.110
That temptation led her to commit a crime.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.400
Say...

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.910
I have a favor to ask.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:34.870
Nanase Karin managed to cleverly 
coax A-san into her hotel room,

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.370
and had her touch her personal belongings.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.300
She made sure to get rid of her 
own fingerprints around the room,

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:45.340
ensuring that only A-san's would remain.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:50.190
I'm sure A-san had some reason 
to want to help Nanase Karin out.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.810
After being depressed 
and considering suicide,

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.570
Nanase Karin coincidentally stopped her,

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.910
making A-san dependent on her.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.910
One might also think she was 
promised financial assistance,

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:03.940
so she was willing to cooperate.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:08.610
So I'm going to act as your 
decoy and lead the media away.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.590
Do you think it'll actually work?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:16.650
They might figure it out right away, 
and I might not be much help.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.250
You'll be fine.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.500
See? It's perfect. Don't worry.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:25.810
Look over there. See that construction site?

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:30.470
The media won't come over there. 
It's the perfect place to meet.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.730
Let's meet there tonight.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.010
If Nanase Karin hadn't met A-san,

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:41.050
she probably would've let 
the rumors run their course,

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:43.070
and would've been able 
to live a happy life.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.560
But while in the pit of despair,

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.330
she had encountered a chance 
to dramatically restart her life.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.600
A-san's face was crushed beyond 
recognition by the steel beams.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.890
This would make it impossible 
to identify her that way.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:26.630
And that would explain that mystery.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:32.620
Why did Nanase Karin let the steel beams 
hit her without any signs of struggle?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.700
That's because the body wasn't her own.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.140
It belonged to someone else

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.190
who'd fallen unconscious and 
had the steel beams fall on her.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:50.630
Nanase Karin finished falsifying 
the scene and fled.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.010
<b>City Hall</b>

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:57.670
She then used A-san's 
identity to begin a new life.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.950
She was thus freed from her past.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.550
Thank you very much. 
Here's your driver's license back.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.460
She would've had to change 
her appearance to make sure

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.020
no one would recognize her, 
but that probably wasn't that difficult.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.990
Someone as gutsy and determined as 
her would've been able to do it.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:20.100
The body that was found at the 
construction site in Makurazaka City

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.000
on January 30th of this year 
did not belong to Nanase Karin.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:26.120
She used the faceless corpse 
trick to fool us all.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.960
Nanase Karin is alive and well.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:31.800
Therefore, there could never be 
a ghost like Steel Lady Nanase!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.230
<i>Then what about Steel Lady Nanase?</i>

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.840
<i>That just means Nanase 
Karin made her up, right?</i>

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:40.970
<i>Why, though?</i>

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:44.930
<b>Anonymous</b>

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:44.930
<b>Anon</b>

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:44.930
<i>If Nanase Karin's alive, 
what the heck is Steel Lady Nanase?</i>

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:49.720
<i>If a ghost appeared, that would mean 
Nanase Karin was definitely dead.</i>

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:53.190
<b>Anon</b>

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:53.190
<i>So it was to make sure people 
really thought she was dead.</i>

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:53.190
<b>Anonymous</b>

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:03.720
<i>But if that's the case, isn't it a bit 
late for Steel Lady Nanase to show up?</i>

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.510
<i>Wait, when did the rumors 
of Nanase's ghost start?</i>

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.220
<i>Around June of this year!</i>

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:12.340
<i>Around February, everyone was still 
freaking out about Nanase Karin's accident.</i>

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:18.050
<i>Wouldn't that just be stirring 
up the hornet's nest?</i>

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.660
<i>There's no way Nanase Karin spread 
the Steel Lady Nanase rumors.</i>

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.430
<i>There's too great a risk that
they'd find out she's alive.</i>

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.150
<i>The site's viewers are now actively 
trying to solve the mystery.</i>

00:10:54.690 --> 00:11:03.050
<b>Nameless</b>

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.220
<i>Hang on a sec.</i>

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.410
<i>Nanase Karin was living her life 
just fine until around May...</i>

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:03.890
<i>But then maybe people started a rumor that 
there was someone who looked like her.</i>

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.590
<i>That's totally possible.</i>

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:08.430
<b>Anonymous</b>

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:09.230
<i>Plastic surgery takes a 
while and has its limits.</i>

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:13.460
<i>I get it. And then, 
Nanase Karin moved away.</i>

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:17.790
<i>But if she thought the same thing 
would happen in the future...</i>

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.890
<i>So to make Nanase Karin completely 
dead in people's minds,</i>

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.390
<i>she created Steel Lady Nanase!</i>

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.860
<i>They're drawing their own conclusions.</i>

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:30.620
<i>They've taken the three 
solutions they were offered,</i>

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.420
<i>changed the stories and the people in them,</i>

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.670
<i>and kept certain elements.</i>

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.090
<i>So does that mean Nanase Karin</i>

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:42.090
<i>dressed up as Steel Lady 
Nanase and attacked people?</i>

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.000
<i>I'm sure she did a couple times.</i>

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.450
<i>To make the rumor spread faster,</i>

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.430
<i>she wore that dress and bow, 
and had a steel beam.</i>

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.680
<i>She made her boobs jiggle, too.</i>

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:51.210
<i>She didn't want anyone to 
think it was an astral body,</i>

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.930
<i>so she created a character named 
Steel Lady Nanase that walked around</i>

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.150
<i>with a smashed face and 
carried a steel beam.</i>

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.150
<i>This logic about why Steel 
Lady Nanase was needed...</i>

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.620
<i>It's the same as the third solution.</i>

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.660
<i>Picking up pieces from that 
solution will give you the answer.</i>

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.210
<i>She basically</i>

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:10.410
<i>showed them how fun it is to logically 
try to explain an urban legend.</i>

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.210
<i>So this was the real reason why
she gave multiple solutions.</i>

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.970
<b>Steel Lady Nanase Wiki</b>

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:16.970
<i>Until now,</i>

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:19.840
<i>this site had gathered up the imaginations</i>

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.640
<356> Name: Anonymous 09/05 00:15 ID.xzawegoj
Her physique and presence are pretty noticeable, so if someone who knew about idols ran into her, that might've started a rumor.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.590
<i>of hundreds of thousands of people 
to give life to Steel Lady Nanase.</i>

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.590
<363> Name: Anonymous 09/05 00:16 ID.omjiae
With all that manipulation happening, anyone would think that Nanase Karin's grudge caused her to come back as the ghost Steel Lady Nanase.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.090
<i>But that's no longer the case.</i>

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>Now, the site's viewers are trying to</i>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:33.100
<i>use that imagination to prove that 
Steel Lady Nanase doesn't exist.</i>

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:43.990
The Ultimate Fiction

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.390
We've won!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.810
Not yet.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:19.310
I haven't delivered the final blow yet.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:23.360
Rikka-san, I'm not going to let 
you grasp the future you desire.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:32.480
Because there is an order to 
this world that must not be

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.030
infringed upon by anyone.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.410
Exactly!

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:41.130
In order to make herself completely 
dead in the public's eyes,

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.250
Nanase Karin created Steel Lady Nanase

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:47.880
and tried to make sure the ghost character 
came to people's minds instantly.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:53.640
<b>Anon</b>

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.440
And this might've all happened

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:54.570
because someone pointed out 
that she looked like Nanase Karin.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:59.010
In order to make sure no one figured out

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:02.090
the swapping of bodies and 
the faceless corpse trick,

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:04.440
she decided to do something extreme.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.770
Nanase Karin started to appear 
in Makurazaka City every night

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.610
and act out Steel Lady Nanase.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.810
Since she was playing the 
ghost version of herself,

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.500
I'm sure it seemed convincing.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.500
The rumors spread, and that name 
became a huge hit on the Internet.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:22.270
And to make sure the 
rumor spread effectively,

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.960
she did something specific.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:29.090
Yes.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.720
She created this Steel 
Lady Nanase Wiki herself!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.180
Nanase Karin!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:43.770
I know that you created this site, 
and that you're the admin!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.890
<i>What?</i>

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.900
<b>Nameless</b>

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.900
<b>Anon</b>

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:45.900
<i>No way...</i>

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.170
I'm sure you're reading 
my posts as we speak.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:54.620
I've been working to expose 
you from the very beginning!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.860
This site spread the rumors about 
Steel Lady Nanase at an ungodly rate

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:01.350
and magnified them.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:04.710
The spread of information 
was just too convenient.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.250
But of course it was.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.300
Because, as the one behind this,

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.900
you had all the information, managed all 
of this, and created Steel Lady Nanase.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:16.390
You tried to reject every single 
solution that I presented.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.390
Name: kuebiko 09/05 00:21 ID. ID.Mmimn43 
You tried to reject every single solution that I presented.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:20.900
All of my solutions were intended 
to erase Steel Lady Nanase,

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:23.410
and having anyone conclude 
that the ghost was fake

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:25.650
would've messed things up for you.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.400
You're trying to make sure 
the rumors spread further,

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.400
so passing on from this life 
would not be ideal.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.200
That's why you tried to 
refute everything I said,

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.870
and even tried to moderate my posts.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.470
This is such a lie.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:41.810
The one who created the site 
and runs it is Rikka-san!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:47.340
I'm pretty sure I told you from 
the start that I'd be lying.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.460
<i>You made this site so that you could 
spread rumors about Steel Lady Nanase?!</i>

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.700
<i>Karin-chan! Did you see my post?!</i>

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.700
<i>I just came here for info
about the urban legend,</i>

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.990
<i>I came here at a good time.</i>

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:53.130
<i>but damn, I could totally 
see Karin-chan doing this.</i>

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.850
<i>The truth is irrelevant in this assembly.</i>

00:15:56.270 --> 00:16:00.410
<i>To anyone who believes this lie, 
this very site that they're looking at</i>

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.870
<i>is the front line of the 
Steel Lady Nanase case.</i>

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:08.230
And now, I will explain why 
you killed Detective Terada.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.220
<i>Hell yeah!</i>

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.820
<i>Lay it all out there!</i>

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.270
<i>Is she really alive?</i>

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.610
<i>I don't want to believe that she's a murderer.</i>

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.580
<i>The real problem is killing the detective.</i>

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.200
<i>Is Nanase Karin going to be arrested?</i>

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.200
<i>What's going to happen?</i>

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.160
Last night, you were in Makurazaka City.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.410
To further spread rumors 
about Steel Lady Nanase,

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.950
you were going to check out the next 
location you planned to cause a scene at.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:30.510
The detective who believed 
Steel Lady Nanase was human saw you

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.300
and thought you were suspicious.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:38.300
You were probably dressed normally, 
but the detective didn't overlook

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.310
the fact that your boobs were huge.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:45.000
Those boobs that reminded 
him of Steel Lady Nanase

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.940
made his detective's intuition go to work.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.380
