00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:25.690
Lately, there've been sightings of a 
suspicious person around Makurazaka City.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.230
I'd like you to answer a few questions.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.930
What are you doing here?

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.870
Um... I'm heading to the convenience 
store to buy a few things.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.360
I got a little hungry.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:39.690
This was the last thing 
you expected to hear.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.870
<i>Have I seen her before?</i>

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.210
<i>No, I've seen her many times. That face...</i>

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:50.710
Nanase...

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.460
Nanase Karin...

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:06.290
A person who was supposed to be 
dead was standing before him,

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:09.350
leaving the usually capable detective 
panicked and defenseless.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:12.110
You saw your chance, and you took it.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.080
After rendering Detective Terada unconscious,

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.140
you decided to make it look like 
Steel Lady Nanase was behind this.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.750
If there was no sign that the 
capable detective fought back

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.760
and his face was smashed in,

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:39.330
it'd be hard for people to believe that 
a woman like you committed the crime.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:01.530
And then you got rid of any 
trace of you having been there

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.460
and fled the scene.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.580
This is the extent of your crimes.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:18.090
If you choose to refute this, 
as well, please, be my guest.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:23.220
But if you can, I'd like you to prove 
that you are not Nanase Karin.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.690
I'll say it again...

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.940
Nanase Karin, you are the killer!

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.950
